# Put smpp.pem here: the certificate chain followed by the private key,
# for SMPP over TLS on port 3550. Never commit the key.

Put the HTTPS certificates in https/: one PEM per host name (chain followed
by key), for the portal domain, API_HOST, DLR_HOST and every reseller's own
portal domain. HAProxy picks the certificate by the name the client asks for,
and refuses to start while this directory has none.
